{"sections":[{"slug":"Hecke叠","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Hecke叠"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">叠</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Hecke 叠"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">叠是特定种类的向量丛的调整</span> (modification) <span lang=\"zh\">的模空间</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定一个</span> $\\mathbb F_q$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的曲线</span> $X$. <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $\\mathbb F_q$-<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span> $S$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义群胚</span> $\\operatorname{Hecke}^r(S)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其对象为如下资料</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X\\times S$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $r$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶向量丛</span> $\\mathcal E$,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">两个映射</span> $0,\\infty \\colon S \\to X$,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">两个调整</span> $\\mathcal E\\hookrightarrow \\mathcal E'\\hookleftarrow\\mathcal E''$ (<span lang=\"zh\">所谓调整是指</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">该映射在指定的闭子概形的补开子概形上为同构</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\mathcal E'/\\mathcal E$ <span lang=\"zh\">支在</span> $\\Gamma_\\infty$ (<span lang=\"zh\">即映射</span> $\\infty$ <span lang=\"zh\">的图像</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, $\\mathcal E'/\\mathcal E''$ <span lang=\"zh\">支在</span> $\\Gamma_0$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且这两个层在支集上为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可逆层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可逆层</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p>$\\operatorname{Hecke}^r(S)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射为上述资料之间的同构</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Shtuka","text":"Shtuka"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}